    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "3. The present FIR came to be registered on the complaint of Jagsir Singh son of Harbans Singh who stated that he was a resident of village Baliala and was known to the accused Gurmangat Singh (petitioner in CRM-M-19874-2022), Pardeep Kumar @ Babbu son of Dalbir Singh, Captain Mangal Singh, Jitender Singh, Jit Singh and Ritu (petitioner in CRM-M-52047-2022). Since he was desirous of getting a job in the military, Gurmangat Singh got him (complainant) introduced with Captain Mangal Singh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1343,
      "end": 1835,
      "entities": [
        {
