          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1665,
          "end": 1669
        },
        {
          "text": "CRM-M-52047-2022",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1685,
          "end": 1701
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurmangat Singh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1760,
          "end": 1775
        },
        {
          "text": "Captain Mangal Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1814,
          "end": 1834
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11243801563978195
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "By alluring Gurmangat Singh got transferred Rs.2 lacs from the account of his (complainant's) brother to his other account (Gurmangat Singh's account).",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1836,
      "end": 1987,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gurmangat Singh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1848,
          "end": 1863
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurmangat Singh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 1960,
          "end": 1975
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2187177836894989
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "A sum of Rs.2 lacs were given to Pardeep Kumar brother of Gurmangat Singh, Captain Mangal Singh and Jagga but neither the complainant nor his nephew got selected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1988,
      "end": 2150,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pardeep Kumar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2021,
          "end": 2034
        },
        {
          "text": "Gurmangat Singh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 2046,
          "end": 2061
        },
        {
          "text": "Captain Mangal Singh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2063,
          "end": 2083
        },
        {
          "text": "Jagga",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2088,
          "end": 2093
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2734068036079407
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Thereafter the accused gave false computer generated gate pass and joining letter and were taken to Agra.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2151,
      "end": 2256,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Agra",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 2251,
          "end": 2255
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2734975814819336
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "They were kept there for 10 days and sent back.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2257,
      "end": 2304,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24693351984024048
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "A sum of Rs.3 lacs was thereafter taken from him (complainant) and his nephew Vicky.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2305,
      "end": 2390,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Vicky",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2384,
          "end": 2389
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25896263122558594
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Action was sought for cheating him of Rs.4 lacs on the pretext of getting him recruited.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2391,
      "end": 2479,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23978430032730103
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "4. The Counsel for the petitioners contends that a compromise has been effected between the parties on 01.03.2022 (Annexure P-1).",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2481,
      "end": 2610,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "01.03.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2584,
          "end": 2594
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23246756196022034
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "The petitioners were in custody since 12.11.2021 and 24.01.2022 respectively.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2611,
      "end": 2688,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "12.11.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2649,
          "end": 2659
        },
        {
          "text": "24.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2664,
          "end": 2674
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20798571407794952
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "Only 02 out of 11 prosecution witnesses had been examined.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2689,
      "end": 2747,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20546044409275055
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "As such the further incarceration of the petitioners was not required.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2748,
      "end": 2818,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17898067831993103
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "5. The Counsel for the complainant has accepted the fact that a compromise has been effected between the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2820,
      "end": 2933,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.12448124587535858
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "He states that he has no have no objection if the petitioners may be granted the concession of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 2934,
      "end": 3034,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07612360268831253
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "2 of 3  CRM-M-19874-2022 # 3#",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3035,
      "end": 3067,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09899501502513885
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "6. The Counsel for the State on the other hand admits the fact that the petitioners have been in custody since 12.11.2021 and 24.01.2022 respectively.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3067,
      "end": 3217,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "12.11.2021",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3178,
          "end": 3188
        },
        {
          "text": "24.01.2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3193,
          "end": 3203
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1179482489824295
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "He also admits to the factum of a compromise having been effected between the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3218,
      "end": 3304,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14225232601165771
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "He however submits that there are three other cases against Gurmangat Singh.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3305,
      "end": 3381,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gurmangat Singh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3365,
          "end": 3380
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.07935751229524612
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "In FIR No.334 he is on bail as a compromise has been effected, in FIR No.366 he has been granted the concession of bail and in FIR No.250 his bail petition is pending adjudication for today.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3382,
      "end": 3572,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13542044162750244
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "Qua petitioner-Ritu, it is submitted that she is an accused in FIR No.250 and her bail application is also listed for hearing today.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3573,
      "end": 3705,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Ritu",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3588,
          "end": 3592
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09864532202482224
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "7. I have heard learned Counsel for the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 3707,
